WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.930
- Panda Express to me is like
white people's Chinese food.

00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:16.083
(Chinese folk music)

00:00:18.497 --> 00:00:20.224
- This is so gross.

00:00:20.224 --> 00:00:22.012
- Wow, this looks like a candle.

00:00:33.672 --> 00:00:35.307
- It's like soggy on the inside.

00:00:42.121 --> 00:00:46.602
(Chinese folk music)

00:00:46.602 --> 00:00:48.085
- If you actually know
real Chinese chow mein,

00:00:48.085 --> 00:00:50.919
you'd be like, "This is
American Chinese chow mein."

00:00:52.456 --> 00:00:54.443
- Ew, it smells like stinky feet.

00:00:56.845 --> 00:00:59.268
- It actually tastes pretty authentic.

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:00.827
- I think it's not that bad.

00:01:03.697 --> 00:01:05.507
- Wow, you've never had
authentic Chinese food before.

00:01:05.507 --> 00:01:06.934
- Yeah, this is judged.

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:08.112
- I'd rather eat this than the egg roll,

00:01:08.112 --> 00:01:09.315
I'll put it that way.

00:01:09.315 --> 00:01:11.896
- Low standards. (laughs)

00:01:11.896 --> 00:01:12.898
- That's how I end up with her.

00:01:12.898 --> 00:01:14.564
- He looks down at Panda Express,

00:01:14.564 --> 00:01:16.311
but he eats McDonald's all the time.

00:01:16.311 --> 00:01:17.855
I don't understand.

00:01:24.346 --> 00:01:25.982
- Melanie likes it.

00:01:25.982 --> 00:01:26.957
Do you want mine?

00:01:26.957 --> 00:01:28.476
(laughs)

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.601
- Good job says my grandpa.

00:01:33.601 --> 00:01:38.601
(Chinese folk music)

00:01:44.096 --> 00:01:46.187
- If you blind folded me,
I'm eating plain rice.

00:01:46.187 --> 00:01:48.457
- It kinda tastes like cardboard.

00:01:59.102 --> 00:02:04.102
(Chinese folk music)

00:02:07.865 --> 00:02:09.186
- It smells so bad.

00:02:09.186 --> 00:02:10.080
- It smells like putrid.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:11.049
- Wow. (laughs)

00:02:14.873 --> 00:02:16.879
- It's really sour. (laughs)

00:02:17.962 --> 00:02:19.119
- Yeah, I do not like that.

00:02:19.119 --> 00:02:20.455
Nope, no.

00:02:25.629 --> 00:02:27.124
- This reminds me of taking shots,

00:02:27.124 --> 00:02:28.561
like the bad aftertaste.

00:02:30.245 --> 00:02:31.379
- They don't like it.

00:02:31.379 --> 00:02:36.234
(Chinese folk music)

00:02:36.665 --> 00:02:38.291
- This is my dad's favorite.

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:41.404
Like if he were here, he would hate this.

00:02:41.404 --> 00:02:42.711
- Oh it smells good.

00:02:42.711 --> 00:02:43.918
- Actually it smells OK.

00:02:43.918 --> 00:02:44.629
- This smells good, yeah.

00:02:44.629 --> 00:02:45.585
- Really? I feel like it smells weird.

00:02:45.585 --> 00:02:46.458
- I like this.

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:47.749
- Oh, it's really salty.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:56.409
(Chinese folk music)

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:58.726
- Orange chicken is not real Chinese food.

00:02:58.726 --> 00:03:01.277
My mom calls it the food
that fools Americans.

00:03:05.767 --> 00:03:06.987
- Oh, no, no, no, I know what this is.

00:03:06.987 --> 00:03:08.119
Burnt soy sauce.

00:03:08.567 --> 00:03:10.349
- Not sure what that is, you know.

00:03:19.231 --> 00:03:21.027
- This chicken is sad.

00:03:22.258 --> 00:03:24.249
- He had to finish all his orange chicken.

00:03:24.249 --> 00:03:25.525
He says it's so good.

00:03:27.765 --> 00:03:29.694
- I can't imagine anyone
thinking that Panda's

00:03:29.694 --> 00:03:31.218
actually Chinese food.

00:03:42.368 --> 00:03:44.167
- But you know what my
dad used to always say

00:03:44.167 --> 00:03:47.580
is that you can't leave one
grain of rice on the plate.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.531
- [Melanie] Yeah, that's
what my mom always said too,

00:03:49.531 --> 00:03:50.871
so I don't like wasting food.

00:03:50.871 --> 00:03:52.821
- Right, did you not get that
when you were younger too?

00:03:52.821 --> 00:03:53.696
- Oh no, all the time.

00:03:53.696 --> 00:03:54.819
- The grain of rice.

